"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdatabricks_monolith=self.webpackChunkdatabricks_monolith||[]).push([[49564],{849564:e=>{e.exports='# Redshift — Validation Scan Pattern\n\nCombined `grepAsset` pattern for validating converted Amazon Redshift output. Load this file via `readSkillFile` at the start of the Validate step. Run with `caseInsensitive: true`, `outputMode: "count"` first; re-run with `outputMode: "content"` for any non-zero count to locate matches. Use the action table below to fix each match.\n\n## Combined pattern\n\n```\n\\b(?:DISTSTYLE|DISTKEY|SORTKEY|ENCODE)\\b|\\$\\$|\\bSYSDATE\\b|\\bGETDATE\\s*\\(|\\bVACUUM\\b|\\bANALYZE\\b|\\bSET\\s+search_path\\b|\\b(?:STV|STL|SVV|SVL|PG)_\\w+|\\bCURRENT_USER_ID\\b|\\bCURRENT_DATABASE\\b|\\bRAISE\\s+(?:EXCEPTION|NOTICE)\\b\n```\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nScan the output for these Redshift remnant patterns that must NOT appear in valid DBSQL:\n\n| Pattern                                       | Redshift construct                                      | Action                                                                                                                                                                                |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `\\b(?:DISTSTYLE\\|DISTKEY\\|SORTKEY\\|ENCODE)\\b` | `DISTSTYLE`, `DISTKEY`, `SORTKEY`, `ENCODE`             | Remove from CREATE TABLE — see `01-schema-and-storage.md`                                                                                                                             |\n| `\\$\\$`                                        | `$$ ... $$ LANGUAGE plpgsql` / `$$ ... $$ LANGUAGE sql` | Strip `$$` and `LANGUAGE` clauses for PL/pgSQL; for SQL UDFs rewrite to inline `RETURN` — see `04-plpgsql.md`                                                                         |\n| `\\$\\$`                                        | `$$ ... $$ LANGUAGE plpythonu`                          | Translate to `LANGUAGE PYTHON` Python UDF when stdlib-only; TODO otherwise — see `04-plpgsql.md`                                                                                      |\n| `\\bSYSDATE\\b\\|\\bGETDATE\\s*\\(`                 | `SYSDATE` / `GETDATE`                                   | Replace with `CURRENT_TIMESTAMP` — see `07-functions.md`                                                                                                                              |\n| `\\bVACUUM\\b`                                  | `VACUUM`                                                | Remove — Delta auto-compacts; Redshift `VACUUM` has no DBSQL equivalent — see `01-schema-and-storage.md`                                                                              |\n| `\\bANALYZE\\b`                                 | `ANALYZE`                                               | Remove when used as routine maintenance; translate to `ANALYZE TABLE t COMPUTE STATISTICS` only if the source explicitly invokes it to refresh stats before a planner-sensitive query |\n| `\\bSET\\s+search_path\\b`                       | `SET search_path`                                       | Replace with `USE SCHEMA catalog.schema` — see `01-schema-and-storage.md`                                                                                                             |\n| `\\b(?:STV\\|STL\\|SVV\\|SVL\\|PG)_\\w+`            | `STV_*`, `STL_*`, `SVV_*`, `SVL_*`, `PG_*` queries      | Remove or TODO                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| `\\bCURRENT_USER_ID\\b\\|\\bCURRENT_DATABASE\\b`   | `CURRENT_USER_ID`, `CURRENT_DATABASE`                   | Replace with `current_user()`, `current_catalog()` — see `07-functions.md`                                                                                                            |\n| —                                             | Unquoted division `/` when source used `NULLIF`         | Preserve `NULLIF(denom, 0)` or `TRY_DIVIDE`                                                                                                                                           |\n| `\\bRAISE\\s+(?:EXCEPTION\\|NOTICE)\\b`           | `RAISE EXCEPTION` / `RAISE NOTICE`                      | Replace with `SIGNAL SQLSTATE \'45000\' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ...` or audit-log insert                                                                                                     |\n| —                                             | Leader-node-only functions                              | Remove or replace — see `07-functions.md`                                                                                                                                             |\n| —                                             | Redshift Lambda UDF references                          | Translate to UC Python UDF invoking Lambda via boto3, or TODO                                                                                                                         |\n| —                                             | Unqualified `ORDER BY` on nullable columns              | Add `NULLS FIRST`/`NULLS LAST` to preserve Redshift\'s NULLs-as-highest ordering                                                                                                       |\n'}}]);
